{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：12:03 2026-10-30 HKT<br/>發佈時間：12:03 2026-10-30 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：12:03 2026-10-30 HKT</p><img alt=\"傷者送院治理。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/faa5551526be71b40eddc1af30bfc388/2026-10/888_41.jpg\"/><p>上水清曉路18號一個地盤對開，今（30日）早上10時50分，一名男工人工作期間，報稱失平衡跌倒，被鐵枝插下巴，消防到場營救，將他救出，惟下顎仍插著鐵支一併送威爾斯親王醫院治理。</p><p>現場為房屋署轄下地盤，正進行地基工程，插有大量鋼筋。警方將事件列工業意外，勞工處及警方跟進調查。</p><img alt=\"傷者送院治理。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4ddb77cb0762773f35050342060ed1a4/2026-10/02_53.jpg\" title=\"傷者送院治理。\"/><p>傷者送院治理。</p><p></p><p></p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-30T04:41:44.727359+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":228,"images":2,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-30T04:03:38+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T04:38:42.687884+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-30T04:38:42.687884+00:00","content_hash":"e28bff68d4cc6844299ddfa17535e401c485f8553d23c8f3c31588862da842be","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}